<description>&lt;h3&gt;SparkFun Electronics' preferred foot prints&lt;/h3&gt;
In this library you'll find discrete semiconductors- transistors, diodes, TRIACs, optoisolators, etc.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
