<plain>
<text x="149.86" y="83.82" size="1.778" layer="97">C10 = 100nF for 100 ohm RTD, 10nF for 1K</text>
<text x="154.94" y="114.3" size="1.778" layer="97">R1 = 4x RTD resistance at 0°C (so 400 ohm for a 100 ohm RTD).
